{"id":"416772","name":"丝瓜扇贝汤","author":"噬血gg","authorId":"10157115","desc":"","cover":"images/416772/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"丝瓜","amount":"2根"},{"name":"扇贝","amount":"200g"},{"name":"秀珍菇","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"海鲜酱","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"盐","amount":"少许"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"少许"},{"name":"葱","amount":"少许"},{"name":"白胡椒粉","amount":"少许"},{"name":"香油","amount":"几滴"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"扇贝解冻，洗净备用。","img":"images/416772/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"丝瓜剖开，切段。","img":"images/416772/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"秀珍菇洗净备用。","img":"images/416772/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"起锅，扇贝冷水下锅，大火煮开转小火焖5分钟。","img":"images/416772/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入丝瓜，大火煮开。","img":"images/416772/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"丝瓜变软，倒入秀珍菇，大火煮开。","img":"images/416772/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入少许盐，鸡精，一勺海鲜酱，胡椒粉。","img":"images/416772/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"起锅前滴入几滴香油，撒上葱花即可。","img":"images/416772/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}